    {
      "parameters": {
        "modelId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "mode": "id",
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=Based on these trends: {{ $json.choices[0].message.content }}\n\nCreate a viral TikTok script about: {{ $('Extract Photo and Theme').first().json.theme }}\n\nWORD COUNT REQUIREMENT: You must write between 50-60 words. Not 20 words, not 80 words - exactly 50 to 60 words.\n\nWhy 50-60 words? Because at natural speaking pace (2.5-3 words per second), this creates a 20-second video.\n\nSCRIPT REQUIREMENTS:\n- Hook: Start with an attention-grabbing first sentence\n- Body: 2-3 engaging sentences about the topic\n- Ending: Strong call-to-action or question\n- Language: Arabic (conversational and natural)\n- NO special characters, emojis, hashtags, or formatting\n\nIMPORTANT: After writing, count your words. If you have less than 50 or more than 60, rewrite.\n\nOutput ONLY the script text, nothing else."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "610387e3-8f6c-4ceb-b66c-f2311a216259",
